function navR39(group){const info=[['guide','book','入门与成长路线','guide'],['character','person','人物与技能','character'],['gear','gear','装备养成','gear'],['atlas','atlas','异界与刷图','atlas-starter'],['tools','tools','资料与工具','tools']];$('#main-nav').innerHTML=info.map(([id,ic,n,r])=>{let subs='';if(group===id){let links={guide:[['learn/start','新手从这里开始'],['guide','成长路线'],['guide/basics','基础概念'],['learn/permanent','永久奖励与功能'],['learn/readiness','出发前验收']],character:[['character','当前阶段配置'],['jewels','人物天赋珠宝'],['special-jewels','特殊人物珠宝'],['gems','技能／辅助宝石清单'],['special-gems','血脉辅助（非天赋珠宝）'],['learn/build-use','导入与装配检查'],['learn/ascendancy','升华点 · 0→8'],['learn/sekhemas','丝克玛试炼'],['learn/chaos','混沌试炼']],gear:[['gear','全身装备目标'],['item/bow','单件完整详情'],['learn/acquisition','装备与材料怎么找']],atlas:[['atlas-starter','新手开荒 · 先看这里'],['atlas-choose','七套方案怎么选'],['atlas/'+state.variant,'当前方案与配套'],['learn/activities','其他试炼与玩法']],tools:[['tools','全部资料'],['tools/filters','过滤器选择与下载'],['filter-guide','颜色、底色与声音'],['filter-check','查物品显示／隐藏'],['tools/dictionary','材料查询'],['learn/audit-beginner','新手复查与未完成项']]}[id];subs=`<div class="subnav">${links.map(([r,n],i)=>routeLink(r,n,(r===current.section||r===current.section+'/'+current.slot||(r==='item/bow'&&current.section==='item'))?'on':'',['character','jewels','special-jewels','gems','special-gems','gear','item/bow'].includes(r)?{stage:state.stage}:{})).join('')}</div>`}return routeLink(r,`${icon(ic,17)}<span>${n}</span>`,'nav-item '+(group===id?'active':''),['gear','character'].includes(r)?{stage:state.stage}:{})+subs}).join('')}
function closeNav(){$('#sidebar').classList.remove('open');$('#mobile-backdrop').classList.remove('open');$('#menu-button').setAttribute('aria-expanded','false')}
function navigate(r,params={}){location.hash=path(r,params)}
let toastTimer;function toast(t){const e=$('#toast');e.textContent=t;e.hidden=false;clearTimeout(toastTimer);toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>e.hidden=true,3500)}
function imageView(view){state.view=view;const v=D.variants.find(x=>x.id===state.variant);$('#atlas-tree-image').src=v.views[view];$$('[data-image-view]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b.dataset.imageView===view)))}
function showImage(id,original=false){$('#modal-image').onerror=null;$('#modal-image').onload=null;const v=D.variants.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!v)return;$('#image-title').textContent=v.name+' · '+(original?'完整原图':'当前视图');$('#modal-image').src=original?v.original:v.views[state.view];$('#modal-image').style.width='100%';$('#modal-image').alt='Fubgun '+v.name+' 用户提供的原始加点截图';$('#image-dialog').showModal()}

let searchResults=[];function updateSearch(){searchResults=searchData($('#search-input').value.trim());$('#search-results').innerHTML=searchResults.map((r,i)=>`<button class="search-result" data-search-result="${i}"><strong>${esc(r.title)}</strong><small>${esc(r.text)}</small></button>`).join('')||'<div class="empty-state">没有匹配结果，试试部位、材料或方案名称。</div>'}
function openSearch(){$('#search-dialog').showModal();$('#search-input').value='';updateSearch();setTimeout(()=>$('#search-input').focus(),0)}
